+/** Inset of the retrace rect from the cell rect, in board-viewBox units. Two 12-unit passes 8
+ *  apart overlap by 4 and fuse into a 20-unit band; see gameCell.css's `.cell-ghost-retrace`.
+ *  8, not 10, is G2's window read on the stamped instrument (pass6/instruments/band.crit.ts,
